#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "You already lead the maximum number of guilds. You cannot siege a new guild unless you lead %(num)s or fewer guilds, but you can try to overthrow a top guildmaster in a guild you already lead."
msgid_plural "You already lead the maximum number of guilds. You cannot siege a new guild unless you lead %(num)s or fewer guilds, but you can try to overthrow a top guildmaster in a guild you already lead."
msgstr[0] "Tayari unaongoza idadi kubwa ya makundi. Huwezi kuchukua kudai chama kipya isipokuwa ukiongoza vikundi vya %(num)s au vichache, lakini unaweza kujaribu kupindua msimamizi wa kikundi cha juu katika kikundi ambacho tayari unaongoza."
msgstr[1] "Tayari unaongoza idadi kubwa ya makundi. Huwezi kuchukua kudai chama kipya isipokuwa ukiongoza vyama vya %(num)s au vichache, lakini unaweza kujaribu kupindua msimamizi wa kikundi cha juu katika kikundi ambacho tayari unaongoza."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "You are currently suspended from %(site)s. You cannot siege any guilds at this time."
msgstr "Kwa sasa umeahirishwa kutoka %(site)sHuwezi kudai vyama vya ushirika wakati huu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "You cannot siege any Guilds right now. You can only make one siege attempt every 7 days, and your account must be at least 7 days old."
msgstr "Kwa sasa huwezi kuwa na ujasiri wa kudai chochote. Unaweza tu kufanya jaribio moja la madai ya kuchukua kila siku 7, na akaunti yako lazima iwe angalau siku 7."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "You may attempt to siege a guild once every 7 days. Any siege attempt - whether successful or not - will trigger this cool-down period."
msgstr "Unaweza kujaribu kuchukua kikundi mara moja kila siku 7. Jaribio lolote la madai ya kuchukua - iwe imefanikiwa au la - litasababisha kipindi hiki cha baridi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "You need to be logged in to siege a Guild."
msgstr "Unahitaji kuingia katika kuchukua ili kudai Chama."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "You should overwrite the previous access code and expiration timestamp with this new information. Continue to use the access token as in Step 5, until it expires."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuandika msimbo wa upatikanaji wa awali na nyakati za kumalizika kwa habari hii mpya. Endelea kutumia ishara ya upatikanaji kama katika hatua ya 5, mpaka muda wake umekwisha."

