#, machine, plain1
msgid "`redirect_uri` - The redirect URI (or one of the URIs) specified in your application information. Must not use HTTP unless using localhost (use HTTPS instead)."
msgstr "`redirect_uri` ya ya redirect URI (au moja ya URIs) iliyotolewa katika taarifa yako ya maombi. Sio lazima kutumia HTTP Ikiwa unatumia mwenyeji wa wavuti (matumizi) HTTPS Badala yake)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "`refresh_token` - the refresh token which you obtained during Step 3"
msgstr "`refresh_token` - Ishara ya kuburudisha ambayo umepata wakati wa hatua ya 3"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "`scope` - A comma-separated list of permission scopes that you are requesting. Valid scopes are: `identity`, `create`, `read`, `update`, `delete`, `vote`, and `guildmaster`."
msgstr "`scope` - Orodha iliyotengwa ya maeneo ya ruhusa ambayo unaomba. Maeneo muhimu ni: `identity`Kwa hivyo, `create`Kwa hivyo, `read`Kwa hivyo, `update`Kwa hivyo, `delete`Kwa hivyo, `vote`Aidha, na `guildmaster`."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "`state` - The state token from earlier."
msgstr "`state` Serikali ya awamu ya kwanza."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "`state` - This is your own anti-cross-site-forgery token. We don't do anything with this, except give it to the user to pass back to you later. You are responsible for generating and validating the state token."
msgstr "`state` - Hii ni ishara yako mwenyewe ya kupambana na spam. Sisi si kufanya chochote na hili, isipokuwa kutoa kwa mtumiaji kupita nyuma kwako baadaye. Wewe ni wajibu wa kuzalisha na kuthibitisha ishara ya serikali."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "a Redirect URI, or a comma-separated list of redirect URIs. May not use HTTP unless using localhost (use HTTPS instead)."
msgstr "moja kwa moja URIAu chagua maneno makuu na uyafanye yake maneno makuu. Haiwezi kutumia HTTP Ikiwa unatumia mwenyeji wa wavuti (matumizi) HTTPS Badala yake)."

